msgid "The text to search for in the messages"
msgstr "메시지에서 검색할 텍스트"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:28
msgid "Ability to limit this for posts from a specific user (or bot)"
msgstr "특정 사용자(또는 봇)의 글로 이를 제한하는 기능"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:29
msgid "Option to mark the task as done (or not)."
msgstr "작업을 완료로 표시할지 여부를 선택하는 옵션."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:31
msgid "Configure tasks to be automatically marked as complete."
msgstr "작업이 자동으로 완료로 표시되도록 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:35
msgid "Conditional tasks"
msgstr "조건부 작업"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
