msgstr ""
"**작업 체크/체크 해제**: OKR.BEST 모바일 앱에서 바로 작업을 완료하거나 다시 "
"엽니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Skip/Unskip tasks**: Mark tasks as skipped or return them to active "
"status as workflow requirements change."
msgstr ""
"**작업 건너뛰기/건너뛰기 해제**: 워크플로 요구 사항이 바뀌면 작업을 건너뜀으로 "
"표시하거나 다시 활성 상태로 되돌립니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:98
msgid "Update tasks"
msgstr "작업 업데이트"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:100
msgid ""
"**Update assignee**: Change who is responsible for completing a task "
"directly from the mobile app."
msgstr ""
"**담당자 업데이트**: 모바일 앱에서 바로 작업 완료를 책임지는 사람을 "
"변경합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Modify due dates**: Adjust task deadlines to accommodate changing "
"priorities and schedules."
msgstr ""
"**마감일 수정**: 우선순위와 일정 변화에 맞춰 작업 마감일을 조정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Edit task commands**: Update slash commands or instructions associated "
"with tasks."
msgstr ""
"**작업 명령어 편집**: 작업과 연결된 슬래시 명령어나 지침을 업데이트합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:103
msgid "**Change run ownership**: Transfer run ownership between team members."
msgstr "**런 소유권 변경**: 팀 구성원 간에 런 소유권을 이전합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:104
msgid ""
"**Rename tasks**: Update a task's name to reflect evolving scope or "
"priorities. (From Mattermost mobile v2.38.0)"
msgstr ""
"**작업 이름 변경**: 변화하는 범위나 우선순위를 반영하도록 작업 이름을 "
"업데이트합니다. (OKR.BEST 모바일 v2.38.0부터)"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Add or edit task descriptions**: Add context to a task or update an "
"existing description. (From Mattermost mobile v2.38.0)"
msgstr ""
"**작업 설명 추가 또는 편집**: 작업에 맥락을 추가하거나 기존 설명을 "
"업데이트합니다. (OKR.BEST 모바일 v2.38.0부터)"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Delete a task**: This action cannot be undone. (From Mattermost mobile "
"v2.37.0)"
msgstr ""
"**작업 삭제**: 이 동작은 취소할 수 없습니다. (OKR.BEST 모바일 v2.37.0부터)"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:108
msgid ""
"These mobile capabilities provide full task management functionality for "
"teams working with playbooks while on mobile devices, complementing your "
